WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,744
You are now more than three generations old

2
00:00:01,744 --> 00:00:03,294
Several rooms in the house all have heirs.

3
00:00:03,294 --> 00:00:05,038
Only you are willing to be empty

4
00:00:05,038 --> 00:00:06,006
I used to urge you

5
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:06,781
You always shirk

6
00:00:06,781 --> 00:00:09,106
Nowadays, even if you continue to study and teach, you will not be able to get married and establish a position.

7
00:00:09,106 --> 00:00:10,269
You keep being so lazy

8
00:00:10,269 --> 00:00:12,400
Don't be compared to her again.

9
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:16,433
The son remembers everything his mother taught him.

10
00:00:16,433 --> 00:00:17,585
The generals are weak in numbers

11
00:00:17,585 --> 00:00:19,314
I pay more attention to the call

12
00:00:19,314 --> 00:00:21,619
It was originally because of the love between husband and wife

13
00:00:21,619 --> 00:00:24,211
I will definitely follow what my mother said in the future

14
00:00:24,211 --> 00:00:25,364
As for continuing

15
00:00:25,364 --> 00:00:27,380
She got married and it was a good match

16
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,973
The day I really have children

17
00:00:29,973 --> 00:00:33,430
This is my congratulations for being an uncle.

18
00:00:33,430 --> 00:00:39,480
It's getting late. My husband, go to the study to practice calligraphy. I'll go back to my room first.

19
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:49,140
I won’t go to the study today.

20
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:53,140
Husband, how many cousins ​​do you have?
